{"displayStem":"두 조건의 박동원 막전위 모식도이다. 최대 이완기 전위와 역치는 같고 기록은 각 조건의 역치 도달까지이다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육 목적으로 구성한 학습자료입니다."}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C02 c02-batch\"><div class=\"evidence c02-vector\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 350\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"교육용 자료 36\" style=\"font-family:Arial,'Noto Sans CJK KR',sans-serif\"><rect width=\"520\" height=\"350\" fill=\"white\"></rect><text x=\"78\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"start\">막전위 (mV)</text><path d=\"M78,60 L78,270\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><path d=\"M78,270 L483,270\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><path d=\"M78.0,270 L78.0,276\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><text x=\"78.0\" y=\"298\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><path d=\"M246.75,270 L246.75,276\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><text x=\"246.75\" y=\"298\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0.5</text><path d=\"M415.5,270 L415.5,276\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><text x=\"415.5\" y=\"298\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><path d=\"M72,218.75 L78,218.75\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><text x=\"66\" y=\"223.75\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"end\">-60</text><path d=\"M72,167.5 L78,167.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><text x=\"66\" y=\"172.5\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"end\">-50</text><path d=\"M72,116.25 L78,116.25\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><text x=\"66\" y=\"121.25\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"end\">-40</text><polyline points=\"78.00,218.75 162.38,193.12 246.75,167.50 331.12,141.88 415.50,116.25\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"></polyline><path d=\"M350,43 L375,43\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><text x=\"383\" y=\"49\" font-size